{
  "name": "duckexplorer",
  "displayName": "DuckExplorer",
  "description": "A DuckDB UI-style analysis workspace: attach DuckDB databases, browse schemas, run SQL notebooks and chart results with Python.",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "publisher": "your-publisher-id",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/altg/DuckExplorer.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/altg/DuckExplorer/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/altg/DuckExplorer#readme",
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.100.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Data Science",
    "Notebooks",
    "Visualization"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "duckdb",
    "sql",
    "database",
    "notebook",
    "data analysis",
    "parquet",
    "csv",
    "pandas",
    "plotly",
    "matplotlib"
  ],
  "main": "./dist/extension.js",
  "activationEvents": [
    "onNotebook:duckexplorer-notebook",
    "onView:duckexplorer.schema",
    "onView:duckexplorer.history",
    "onLanguage:sql"
  ],
  "contributes": {
    "notebooks": [
      {
        "type": "duckexplorer-notebook",
        "displayName": "DuckDB Notebook",
        "selector": [
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.duckbook"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "notebookRenderer": [
      {
        "id": "duckexplorer-renderer",
        "displayName": "DuckExplorer Results",
        "entrypoint": "./dist/renderer.js",
        "mimeTypes": [
          "application/vnd.duckexplorer.table+json",
          "application/vnd.duckexplorer.plotly+json",
          "application/vnd.duckexplorer.vegalite+json"
        ],
        "requiresMessaging": "optional"
      }
    ],
    "viewsContainers": {
      "activitybar": [
        {
          "id": "duckexplorer",
          "title": "DuckExplorer",
          "icon": "media/duck.svg"
        }
      ],
      "panel": [
        {
          "id": "duckexplorer-results",
          "title": "DuckDB Results",
          "icon": "media/duck.svg"
        }
      ]
    },
    "views": {
      "duckexplorer": [
        {
          "id": "duckexplorer.schema",
          "name": "Databases"
        },
        {
          "id": "duckexplorer.history",
          "name": "Query History"
        }
      ],
      "duckexplorer-results": [
        {
          "type": "webview",
          "id": "duckexplorer.results",
          "name": "Results"
        }
      ]
    },
    "viewsWelcome": [
      {
        "view": "duckexplorer.schema",
        "contents": "Attach a DuckDB database file to browse its schemas, tables and columns.\n[Add Database](command:duckexplorer.addDatabase)\n[New Notebook](command:duckexplorer.newNotebook)\nTo query a CSV, Parquet, JSON or Excel file, right-click it in the Explorer and choose Open in DuckExplorer: it is listed here as a view in the files database."
      },
      {
        "view": "duckexplorer.history",
        "contents": "The queries you run in DuckDB notebooks and .sql files are listed here, newest first, to look at, run again or find where they ran."
      }
    ],
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.addDatabase",
        "title": "Add Database…",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(add)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.openFiles",
        "title": "Open in DuckExplorer",
        "category": "DuckExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.closeFile",
        "title": "Close File",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(close)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.detachDatabase",
        "title": "Detach Database",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(debug-disconnect)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.refresh",
        "title": "Refresh",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(refresh)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.runStatement",
        "title": "Run Statement",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(play)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.runFile",
        "title": "Run File",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(run-all)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.newNotebook",
        "title": "New DuckDB Notebook",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(notebook)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.previewTable",
        "title": "Preview Table",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(table)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.showSummary",
        "title": "Show Summary",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(graph)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.writeSql",
        "title": "Write SQL from a Description…",
        "shortTitle": "Write SQL",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(sparkle)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.toggleLivePreview",
        "title": "Toggle Live Preview",
        "category": "DuckExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.startLivePreview",
        "title": "Turn On Live Preview",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(eye)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.stopLivePreview",
        "title": "Turn Off Live Preview",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(eye-closed)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.showViewSql",
        "title": "Show SQL",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(code)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.exportTable",
        "title": "Export…",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(export)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.copyName",
        "title": "Copy Name",
        "category": "DuckExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.showQuery",
        "title": "Show Query",
        "category": "DuckExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.rerunQuery",
        "title": "Run Again",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(play)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.openQuery",
        "title": "Open in Editor",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(edit)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.runQueryInNotebook",
        "title": "Run in Notebook",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(notebook)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.goToQuerySource",
        "title": "Go to Source",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(go-to-file)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.copyQuery",
        "title": "Copy Query",
        "category": "DuckExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.removeQuery",
        "title": "Remove from History",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(close)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.searchHistory",
        "title": "Search Query History…",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(search)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.clearHistory",
        "title": "Clear Query History",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(clear-all)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.restartKernel",
        "title": "Restart Kernel",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(debug-restart)"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.showLog",
        "title": "Show Kernel Log",
        "category": "DuckExplorer",
        "icon": "$(output)"
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "view/title": [
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.addDatabase",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.newNotebook",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.refresh",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema",
          "group": "navigation@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.restartKernel",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema",
          "group": "overflow"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.showLog",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema",
          "group": "overflow"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.searchHistory",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.history",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.clearHistory",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.history",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        }
      ],
      "view/item/context": [
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.previewTable",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema && viewItem =~ /^(table|view)/",
          "group": "inline"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.showSummary",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema && viewItem =~ /^(table|view)/",
          "group": "1_main@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.previewTable",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema && viewItem =~ /^(table|view)/",
          "group": "1_main@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.showViewSql",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema && viewItem =~ /^view/",
          "group": "1_main@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.exportTable",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema && viewItem =~ /^(table|view)/",
          "group": "1_main@4"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.copyName",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema && viewItem != message",
          "group": "1_main@5"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.detachDatabase",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema && viewItem == database.attached",
          "group": "inline"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.detachDatabase",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema && viewItem == database.attached",
          "group": "2_manage@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.closeFile",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema && viewItem == view.file",
          "group": "inline"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.closeFile",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.schema && viewItem == view.file",
          "group": "2_manage@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.rerunQuery",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.history && viewItem == query",
          "group": "inline@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.openQuery",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.history && viewItem == query",
          "group": "inline@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.rerunQuery",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.history && viewItem == query",
          "group": "1_run@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.runQueryInNotebook",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.history && viewItem == query",
          "group": "1_run@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.openQuery",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.history && viewItem == query",
          "group": "2_open@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.goToQuerySource",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.history && viewItem == query",
          "group": "2_open@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.copyQuery",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.history && viewItem == query",
          "group": "3_copy@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.removeQuery",
          "when": "view == duckexplorer.history && viewItem =~ /^(query|day)$/",
          "group": "4_remove@1"
        }
      ],
      "commandPalette": [
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.previewTable",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.showSummary",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.showViewSql",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.exportTable",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.copyName",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.openFiles",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.closeFile",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.detachDatabase",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.showQuery",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.rerunQuery",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.openQuery",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.runQueryInNotebook",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.goToQuerySource",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.copyQuery",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.removeQuery",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.runStatement",
          "when": "editorLangId == sql && !notebookEditorFocused && config.duckexplorer.sqlFiles"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.runFile",
          "when": "editorLangId == sql && !notebookEditorFocused && config.duckexplorer.sqlFiles"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.startLivePreview",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.stopLivePreview",
          "when": "false"
        }
      ],
      "editor/title": [
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.startLivePreview",
          "when": "resourceLangId == sql && config.duckexplorer.sqlFiles && !config.duckexplorer.livePreview",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.stopLivePreview",
          "when": "resourceLangId == sql && config.duckexplorer.sqlFiles && config.duckexplorer.livePreview",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        }
      ],
      "notebook/toolbar": [
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.writeSql",
          "when": "notebookType == duckexplorer-notebook",
          "group": "navigation@10"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.startLivePreview",
          "when": "notebookType == duckexplorer-notebook && !config.duckexplorer.livePreview",
          "group": "navigation@11"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.stopLivePreview",
          "when": "notebookType == duckexplorer-notebook && config.duckexplorer.livePreview",
          "group": "navigation@11"
        }
      ],
      "editor/title/run": [
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.runFile",
          "when": "resourceLangId == sql && config.duckexplorer.sqlFiles",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.runStatement",
          "when": "resourceLangId == sql && config.duckexplorer.sqlFiles",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        }
      ],
      "editor/context": [
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.writeSql",
          "when": "editorLangId == sql && (notebookEditorFocused || config.duckexplorer.sqlFiles)",
          "group": "duckexplorer@0"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.runStatement",
          "when": "editorLangId == sql && !notebookEditorFocused && config.duckexplorer.sqlFiles",
          "group": "duckexplorer@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.runFile",
          "when": "editorLangId == sql && !notebookEditorFocused && config.duckexplorer.sqlFiles",
          "group": "duckexplorer@2"
        }
      ],
      "explorer/context": [
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.runFile",
          "when": "resourceLangId == sql && config.duckexplorer.sqlFiles",
          "group": "duckexplorer@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "duckexplorer.openFiles",
          "when": "resourceScheme == file && resourceFilename =~ /\\.(duckdb|ddb|db|parquet|xlsx|(csv|tsv|json|jsonl|ndjson)(\\.(gz|zst))?)$/i",
          "group": "duckexplorer@2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "keybindings": [
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.runStatement",
        "key": "ctrl+enter",
        "mac": "cmd+enter",
        "when": "editorTextFocus && editorLangId == sql && !notebookEditorFocused && config.duckexplorer.sqlFiles"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.runFile",
        "key": "ctrl+shift+enter",
        "mac": "cmd+shift+enter",
        "when": "editorTextFocus && editorLangId == sql && !notebookEditorFocused && config.duckexplorer.sqlFiles"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.removeQuery",
        "key": "delete",
        "mac": "cmd+backspace",
        "when": "focusedView == duckexplorer.history && !inputFocus"
      },
      {
        "command": "duckexplorer.copyQuery",
        "key": "ctrl+c",
        "mac": "cmd+c",
        "when": "focusedView == duckexplorer.history && !inputFocus"
      }
    ],
    "configuration": {
      "title": "DuckExplorer",
      "properties": {
        "duckexplorer.pythonPath": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "description": "Python interpreter for the DuckExplorer kernel. Leave empty to use the interpreter selected in the Python extension, then `python` on PATH."
        },
        "duckexplorer.pageSize": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 200,
          "minimum": 10,
          "maximum": 5000,
          "description": "Rows fetched per page in the results grid."
        },
        "duckexplorer.maxPandasRows": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 1000000,
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "Maximum rows copied into the pandas DataFrame (`df` and named results) after each SQL cell. 0 disables the DataFrame copy."
        },
        "duckexplorer.sqlFiles": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Run .sql files with DuckDB: a Run button above each statement and in the editor title, Ctrl+Enter (the statement at the cursor or the selection) and Ctrl+Shift+Enter (the file), and completions while the kernel runs."
        },
        "duckexplorer.livePreview": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "markdownDescription": "Live preview, like DuckDB's Instant SQL: the query at the cursor in a SQL cell or `.sql` file runs as you write it, and the DuckDB Results view (in the panel) shows its first 100 rows. With the cursor in one of its CTEs, it shows that CTE's rows. Only queries run: nothing that changes the database, and a preview that takes more than 5 seconds is stopped."
        },
        "duckexplorer.languageModel": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "markdownDescription": "The language model that **Write SQL from a Description** asks, by its id, family or name, from the models VS Code offers (GitHub Copilot's, or another extension's). Empty: the only one, or the one you pick the first time. The request, the names and types of your tables, views, columns and DataFrames (with their comments) and the SQL around the cursor go to the model's provider; no rows do."
        },
        "duckexplorer.historySize": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 500,
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 10000,
          "description": "How many queries the Query History keeps for this workspace. 0 stops recording. Queries that create secrets or set credentials are never kept."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "compile": "npm run typecheck && node esbuild.mjs",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p . --noEmit && tsc -p src/renderer --noEmit",
    "watch": "node esbuild.mjs --watch",
    "dev": "npm run compile && node scripts/dev.mjs",
    "compile-tests": "tsc -p test",
    "pretest": "npm run compile && npm run compile-tests",
    "test": "node out-test/runTest.js",
    "test:unit": "tsc -p test/unit && mocha --ui tdd out-unit/test/unit/*.test.js",
    "test:python": "python -m pytest python/tests -q",
    "vscode:prepublish": "node -e \"require('fs').rmSync('dist', { recursive: true, force: true })\" && npm run typecheck && node esbuild.mjs --production",
    "package": "vsce package --no-dependencies"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@vscode/python-extension": "^1.0.6"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/mocha": "^10.0.10",
    "@types/node": "^22.20.5",
    "@types/vscode": "~1.100.0",
    "@types/vscode-notebook-renderer": "^1.72.4",
    "@vscode/test-electron": "^3.1.0",
    "@vscode/vsce": "^4.1.0",
    "esbuild": "^0.28.2",
    "mocha": "^11.8.0",
    "plotly.js-dist-min": "^4.1.2",
    "typescript": "~5.9.3",
    "vega": "^6.4.0",
    "vega-embed": "^7.3.0",
    "vega-interpreter": "^2.3.2",
    "vega-lite": "^6.5.0"
  }
}
